# Denylist context for the reproducible verifier build (tools/reproduce).
#
# The fsv_* build pulls `full_statement_verifier` & friends, which inherit
# dependencies from the ROOT workspace ({ workspace = true }). Loading that
# workspace validates EVERY member manifest, so the whole source tree must be
# present — a hand-maintained allowlist goes stale the moment a crate is added
# (which is exactly what happened to the previous version of this file). Ship
# all source, and only carve out build output and large binary artifacts.

# Version control.
.git

# All Cargo build outputs (target/ alone is tens of GB).
target
**/target

# Regenerated verifier artifacts — the reproducible build rebuilds these from
# source inside the image, so they must not enter the context.
tools/gkr_verifier/*.bin
tools/gkr_verifier/*.elf
tools/gkr_verifier/*.text

# Non-source data not needed to compile the workspace (examples/ is not a
# workspace member and is not in the fsv build's dependency tree).
examples
*.pdf

# Temporary files that may be artifacts of large on-disk proof caches
**/*.rscw
**/*.tree